  "title": "Jeff Davis Pie II",
  "description": "A rich cousin to the classic pecan pie, this version has dates and raisins as well as pecans, lots of brown sugar, eggs, cream and butter. And its plenty spicy with allspice and nutmeg. Serve it with unsweetened whipped cream.",
  "authors": [
